t sincerity and actual affection cannot be determined.\",\"recognised_work\":false,\"recognition_note\":\"The isolated expression does not identify a particular work.\",\"limitations\":\"Only the target expression is supplied. Relationship history, delivery, sincerity, preceding or subsequent commitments, and the addressee's uptake are unavailable.\"}"
